<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Error Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Fusion of Visual and Textual Features</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Vela</span> in Reference-free Setting</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Zero-shot Evaluation on Short Caption Benchmarks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Scoring Criteria for Annotation</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A9.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix I Scoring Criteria for Annotation ‣ Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Descriptiveness:</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A9.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix I Scoring Criteria for Annotation ‣ Vela: An LLM-Hybrid-as-a-Judge Approachfor Evaluating Long Image Captions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Relevance:</span></a></li>
