<span id="A5.T5.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Fluency issues</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T5.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T5.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
