</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 1.00006pt;">
<span id="A11.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Qwen2.5 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib58" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2024)</a></cite>:</span>
</span></td></tr>
